21
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,840
That person took down the Moongazer Serpent in a single palm strike !

22
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:11,810
This time, the Thunder Celestial Temple

23
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:13,710
has truly surpassed the various families of Allheaven.

24
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:16,550
That person

25
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:19,510
is likely the one Moongazer Serpent feared back then.

26
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:22,400
The Moongazer Serpent has submitted.

27
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:24,840
As for the inheritance the little Ancient God spoke of,

28
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:26,150
I still need to consider it carefully.

29
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,710
The Yao Family isn't done chasing me.

30
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:31,030
I don't have much time left.

31
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:34,720
Heng Yun Peak
Planet Qing Ling

32
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:43,910
Benefactor

33
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,110
Did you have a safe trip ?

34
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,670
Thanks to Benefactor's protection,

35
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,320
everything went smoothly.

36
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,270
But on the way, we learned about

37
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,030
the Yao Family of Allheaven.

38
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,310
I can handle this matter myself.

39
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:57,470
You guys can cultivate in peace on Planet Qing Ling.

40
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:58,950
For the next few months,

41
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,030
I will be in seclusion.

42
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,200
Unless there are urgent matters,

43
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:03,190
do not disturb me.

44
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:04,830
Understood.

45
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,430
In order to survive

46
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,880
the next situation,

47
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:13,480
I need to have breakthrough in my cultivation.

48
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:26,680
This cauldron has a connection with Ancient Gods.

49
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,630
The more it's refined,

50
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:28,950
the stronger it is.

51
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:30,790
But right now,

52
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,750
I don't have the time to study it closely.

53
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,310
Refining her into a Celestial Guard

54
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,150
is an option.

55
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,270
But before that,

56
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,310
her Nirvana Scryer origin energy

57
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:50,960
should be enough to help me breakthrough past Corporeal Yang.

58
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,710
Congratulations Master,

59
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:29,390
you only took 30% of this person's origin energy

60
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,790
and have already reached Peak Corporeal Yang !

61
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:33,950
Why don't you seize this opportunity ?

62
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,830
Let's get straight to Nirvana Scryer !

63
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,310
Taking more origin energy

64
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:44,190
is useless now.

65
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,430
What's holding me back

66
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:47,990
isn't origin energy

67
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,270
but my domain.

68
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,470
The Karma Domain

69
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:55,190
is harder to grasp than the Life and Death Reincarnation Cycle.

70
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,310
Advancing any further

71
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,500
is like fishing the moon in a pond

72
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:01,350
or picking flowers in the fog.

73
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:04,790
Karma...

74
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:24,000
I obtained the Heaven Defying Bead,

75
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,320
that is the karmic cause.

76
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,670
Then I met Senior Situ,

77
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:31,670
that is the karmic effect.

78
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,910
Teng Li wanting to kill me was the karmic cause,

79
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,710
me killing Teng Li was the karmic effect.

80
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:44,870
Tie Zhu...

81
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,670
You will pay with your life for my grandson !

82
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,510
Karma

83
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,360
(Situ Nan) From now on, I’ll teach you cultivation.

84
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:54,920
(Li Muwan) Senior...

85
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,950
is everywhere.

86
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:55,960
(Da Niu) Thank you Uncle Wang !

87
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,880
(Yunque Zi) You don't need to know who I am.

88
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,600
(Mo Zhi) Either you understand

89
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:01,080
(Mo Zhi) or you don't.

90
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:01,070
But karma is illusory.

91
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,120
(Zhou Yi) Take good care of her.

92
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:04,360
(Du Tian) You're the only core disciple of the Soul Refining Sect !

93
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:03,590
Seeing through its essence

94
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:04,960
(Li Muwan) Senior...

95
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:05,750
is difficult.

96
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,430
(Du Jian) I saw Master

97
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:10,630
devour Sun Yun !

98
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:17,910
My disciple,

99
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:20,630
you have doubts in your heart.

100
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,670
The Dao of Karma

101
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,310
is ethereal and elusive.

102
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,950
Its origin is hard to fathom.

103
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,310
How will you

104
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,830
comprehend this Dao on your own ?

105
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,950
Devour the domains of others

106
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,870
to condense your own Dao.

107
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,630
Back then, I thought these 3600 avatars

108
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:47,430
were 3600 celestials spells.

109
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,980
But it turns out each one

110
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,550
is what remains after a domain

111
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,950
was extracted.

112
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,790
This method

113
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,470
is the most direct way to complete the Karma Domain.

114
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,590
Isn't there someone

115
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,550
right below your eyes ?

116
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,550
Devour her...

117
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,350
Devour her !

118
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,630
Devour her !

119
00:07:21,310 --> 00:07:22,620
Devour her !

120
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:22,640
Master

121
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:23,840
devoured Sun Yun !

122
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:26,800
That's not right.

123
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,840
The All-Seer devoured thousands of domains

124
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,520
and his Dao is indeed powerful.

125
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:36,510
But he hasn't reached the third step after tens of thousands of years.

126
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,470
Devouring is a shortcut

127
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:42,040
but it makes the Dao Heart increasingly impure.

128
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:43,310
One day,

129
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,190
it will backfire.

130
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,350
If you don't devour her,

131
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,630
your Karma Domain

132
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:54,390
will never take shape.

133
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,110
My Dao

134
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:59,440
is something I will seek by myself.

135
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:20,350
Karma is everywhere.

136
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,590
But what's the Dao of Karma ?

137
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:31,000
Cloud Pavilion
Thunder Celestial Temple

138
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:34,990
His body is still there,

139
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:36,750
his Origin Soul hasn't left,

140
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:40,110
but his Dao intent has scattered across an entire planet.

141
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:43,030
This is

142
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:45,560
the Dream Dao.

143
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:49,280
At the beginning of heaven and earth,

144
00:08:49,310 --> 00:08:51,200
there was a mortal named Peng Zu

145
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,400
who gained enlightment about the Dao in a dream.

146
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,790
He became an Ancient Celestial

147
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,790
and recorded tens of thousands of Dao Hearts,

148
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,760
by contemplating the heavens, the earth, the sun, and the moon.

149
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,470
Master once said

150
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,630
that among millions of cultivators,

151
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,630
not even a single one

152
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,800
might attain the Dream Dao.

153
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:12,070
If one cannot wake up from this dream,

154
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:15,870
then their Dao is destroyed and they die.

155
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:29,310
The strong prey on the weak,

156
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:30,670
that is karma.

157
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:33,520
But if karma is only the strong oppressing the weak,

158
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,400
then the Dao

159
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:37,310
is just will of the heavens oppressing people.

160
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:40,190
This is not the Dao of Karma.

161
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:02,410
Don't be afraid.

162
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,030
From now on,

163
00:10:04,520 --> 00:10:05,910
your name will be Little Black.

164
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,670
Alright ?

165
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:17,350
Little Black...

166
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:19,870
A single thought of kindness

167
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,750
forged a lifelong bond,

168
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:23,510
that is karma.

169
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,310
I was just following orders !

170
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,270
I'm not the one who killed your family !

171
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:32,150
But my family

172
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,750
died because of you !

173
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:40,350
Father...

174
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,110
Mother...

175
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:44,830
I have avenged you.

176
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:48,240
An evil cause leads to a resentment effect,

177
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:50,150
that is also karma.

178
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:52,990
Good and evil both have effects.

179
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:56,070
But karma is not just the retribution of good and evil.

180
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:59,270
This isn't the Dao of Karma either.

181
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:11,920
He's born !

182
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:12,790
He's born !

183
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,640
Take it slow.

184
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:58,000
The weak and the strong are karma.

185
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:00,030
Good and evil are karma.

186
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:01,910
Life and death

187
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,550
are also karma.

188
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,190
But how exactly

189
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,670
does karma become the Dao ?

190
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,390
The Dao is in all things.

191
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:19,630
Anyone can learn it.

192
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:23,230
I have been studying books of the sages for 60 years

193
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:23,560
Xie Qing
Great mortal scholar

194
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,760
and don't dare to claim I have attained the Dao.

195
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,230
But I know one thing.

196
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,590
Caring about others

197
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:32,070
is a part of the Dao.

198
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,470
Extend it to all things

199
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,670
and it becomes the Great Dao.

200
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,230
Master, do you know

201
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,350
what the Dao of Karma is ?

202
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,350
Karma ?

203
00:12:43,280 --> 00:12:45,110
In all my life of reading,

204
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:48,470
I have never seen anyone use the words "cause" and "effect"

205
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,510
together like this

206
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:52,750
to ask about the Dao.

207
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,390
Stop sleeping.

208
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,350
Mister,

209
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:06,110
what's the Dao of Karma ?

210
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:11,920
Note: These sayings come from confucian records.

211
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:09,710
Ruler and subject, father and son,

212
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,910
Cultivate oneself, regulate the family, govern the state, bring peace to the world.

213
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:16,190
The Dao is among the mountains and rivers,

214
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:17,750
it can't be spoken.

215
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,270
With a blade in hand,

216
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:23,750
when your heart is fearless,

217
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,310
that is the Dao.

218
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,990
There are countless truths in the world.

219
00:13:28,880 --> 00:13:29,750
But truths

220
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:31,990
are not the Dao.

221
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:46,240
Dao

222
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:49,070
The Dao of Karma, he said...

223
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:01,720
Will of
the Heavens

224
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:03,760
Human
Ethics

225
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,320
Revenge

226
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,200
Good
and Evil

227
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,200
Life
and Death

228
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:23,630
If a cause

229
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:25,830
corresponds to an effect,

230
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:29,120
but the cause and the effect

231
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:31,190
are not connected with one another,

232
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:31,560
Effect

233
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:34,720
Cause    Effect

234
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:34,630
then how do they become the Dao ?

235
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,190
I have become this planet.

236
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,670
I exist alongside all things.

237
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:09,230
Why am I even more confused than before ?

238
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:19,600
Every thought,

239
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:21,080
every object,

240
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:23,470
every word, every action,

241
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,790
will lead to karma.

242
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:28,990
But where is

243
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,110
its shape ?

244
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:38,950
Teacher Xie,

245
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:40,550
No teaching today ?

246
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:42,310
Are you here to watch me fish instead ?

247
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,910
The line is in his hand.

248
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:48,080
The fish are under the water.

249
00:15:48,560 --> 00:15:51,080
The fish eating the bait and taking the hook is the karmic cause,

250
00:15:51,520 --> 00:15:53,430
the fish being caught is the karmic effect.

251
00:15:55,040 --> 00:15:56,710
The cause is in the hand,

252
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:59,430
the effect is in the dark.

253
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:01,670
What do you mean "the line" ?

254
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:03,710
What's important is the fish taking the bait.

255
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:26,470
I finally understand.

256
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:28,630
Understand what ?

257
00:16:29,800 --> 00:16:30,990
I am the fish

258
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,400
and the Dao is the net !

259
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,580
What are you saying ?

260
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:39,000
The river is the heavens !

261
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,880
The fish is in the river,

262
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:43,640
unaware of the shore beyond the river.

263
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:45,600
Only after entering the net

264
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:48,440
does it learn that it has always been bound by its laws.

265
00:16:49,280 --> 00:16:50,310
Teacher Xie,

266
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:52,680
you've read so much that you've lost your mind.

267
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:54,680
The one holding the net

268
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:56,270
is fate itself !

269
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:13,840
I am the fish,

270
00:17:14,600 --> 00:17:15,880
the Dao is the net,

271
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:17,840
and the river is the heavens.

272
00:17:19,360 --> 00:17:21,560
A fish keeps struggling in the net.

273
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:22,790
This struggle

274
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:24,590
is defiance !

275
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:26,750
So the Dao of Karma

276
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:28,230
wasn't somewhere else.

277
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,430
It was within myself.

278
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:33,120
The weak and the strong,

279
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,840
good and evil,

280
00:17:35,760 --> 00:17:36,880
hatred and resentment,

281
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,320
Life and Death,

282
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,030
are all karma !

